WEBVTT

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:21.960
I see...

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.750
That must have been too easy a job for you.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:25.380
It was fine.

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.040
So, about that job we put on hold.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.960
Carry it out right away.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:31.750
You have one week to do it.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:33.000
No problem.

